@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@adminPhone = 13800000001
@adminPassword = 替换为本地admin密码

### 1. 登录 admin，获取后台 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{adminPhone}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 2. 预热当前压测票档库存到 Redis / bucket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ticket-categories/{{ticketCategoryId}}/stock/preheat
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 3. 查询所有库存视图，确认 redisAvailableStock、diff、一致性
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 4. 如果要预热所有票档，用这个
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/preheat-all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 5. 兼容旧接口：预热单个票档
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/preload
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 6. 兼容旧接口：预热所有票档
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/preload
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
